  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection of Women and Girls through GBV Response KAALO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at transforming  dominant norms prevailing in Somalia in order to protect girls and women from violence and harmful practices. In addition, it will empower women and adolescent girls to have the capacity to lead, build self-esteem and realize their rights.</narrative>
  </description>
